    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταγενής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>born after</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ μεταγενής</span>
			<i>the youngest</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				154
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έστερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				80
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ μεταγενέστεροι</span>
			<i>posterity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				11.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.8.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				4p.426M.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of later time</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταγενέστεροι συγγραφεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Th.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			: hence, in Philos., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα -έστερα
				τῶν γενῶν τοῦ ὄντος</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.850
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. μετὰ ταῦτα τὴν
				πολυπραγμοσύνην</span>
			<i>consequent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.262
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i></div>
